# Copy to .env.local and fill in. Nothing here is a working default ON PURPOSE.
#
# This file used to name ariyvnxeywozmwxmylhb, which is the OLD rentals project kept only as
# a rollback copy of the 2026-07 migration. Pointing the new site at it would read stale data
# that nobody writes to any more, and would look like it was working. A blank that fails loudly
# is safer than a reference that is quietly wrong.
#
# Which project to use:
#   - The new site is meant to run on its OWN Supabase project, cloned from the live rentals
#     database with scripts/clone-database.sh (see CLONE.md). That project does not exist yet;
#     it has to be created in the new account first.
#   - Current live rentals production is amyqxovbnlreassrqihr. Read against it for local
#     development if you must, but never write to it and never ship pointing at it.
#   - ariyvnxeywozmwxmylhb is the old rollback copy. Do not use it.
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
